{"ticker":"DTE","updated":"2026-10-30T22:45:22Z","profile":{"longName":"DTE Energy Company","shortName":"DTE Energy Company","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","country":"United States","website":"https://www.dteenergy.com","fullTimeEmployees":9592,"marketCap":28193853440,"trailingPE":21.472267,"forwardPE":16.294865,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.7123506,"pegRatio":1.73,"targetMeanPrice":148.03333,"targetHighPrice":168.0,"targetLowPrice":135.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":-0.015,"earningsGrowth":0.224,"grossMargins":0.29347,"operatingMargins":0.13623999,"profitMargins":0.07999,"totalRevenue":16465000448,"beta":0.375,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":155.75,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":119.68,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.46},"summary":"DTE Energy Company engages in energy-related businesses and services. The company operates through four segments: Electric, Gas, DTE Vantage, and Energy Trading. The company's Electric segment generates, purchases, distributes, and sells electricity to approximately 2.3 million residential, commercial, and industrial customers in southeastern Michigan. It generates electricity through coal-fired plants, natural gas plant, hydroelectric pumped storage, and nuclear plants, as well as wind and solar assets. This segment owns and operates 702 distribution substations with a capacity of approximately 37,870,000 kilovolt-amperes (kVA) and approximately 4,56,900 line transformers with a capacity of approximately 33,770,000 kVA. The company's Gas segment purchases, stores, transports, distributes, and sells natural gas to approximately 1.4 million residential, commercial, and industrial customers throughout Michigan; and sells storage and transportation capacity. This segment has approximately 21,000 miles of distribution mains; 1,242,000 service pipelines; and 1,361,000 active meters, as well as owns approximately 2,000 miles of transmission pipelines. Its DTE Vantage segment offers metallurgical and petroleum coke to steel and other industries; and power generation, steam production, chilled water production, and wastewater treatment services, as well as compressed air supply to indu","summary_zh":"DTE Energy Company 從事能源相關業務和服務。該公司透過四個部門運作：電力部門、天然氣部門、DTE Vantage 部門和能源貿易部門。該公司的電力部門為密西根州東南部約 230 萬住宅、商業和工業客戶生產、購買、分配和銷售電力。它透過燃煤電廠、天然氣電廠、水力發電抽水蓄能電廠、核電廠以及風能和太陽能資產發電。該分部擁有並經營702座配電變電站，容量約37,870,000千伏安（kVA），以及約456,900台線路變壓器，容量約33,770,000 kVA。該公司的天然氣部門為密西根州約 140 萬住宅、商業和工業客戶購買、儲存、運輸、分銷和銷售天然氣；並出售儲存和運輸能力。該部分擁有約 21,000 英里的配電幹線； 1,242,000條服務管道；和 1,361,000 個有源電錶，並擁有約 2,000 英里的傳輸管道。其 DTE Vantage 部門為鋼鐵和其他行業提供冶金焦和石油焦；和發電、蒸汽生產、冷凍水生產和廢水處理服務，以及工業壓縮空氣供應","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh":"公用事業 - 受監管的電力","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":135.99,"h":136.43,"l":135.13,"c":135.65,"v":900300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":135.16,"h":135.89,"l":134.76,"c":135.49,"v":868900},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":136.5,"h":136.85,"l":135.42,"c":136.41,"v":1089800},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":137.0,"h":137.2,"l":135.85,"c":136.6,"v":976000},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":136.13,"h":136.38,"l":134.12,"c":134.74,"v":1035500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":134.37,"h":135.87,"l":134.37,"c":135.11,"v":634400},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":135.1,"h":136.13,"l":134.61,"c":135.64,"v":933000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":135.7,"h":136.97,"l":135.35,"c":136.76,"v":869700},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":136.47,"h":137.29,"l":135.98,"c":136.84,"v":940300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":135.84,"h":136.72,"l":135.76,"c":136.45,"v":943200},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":135.77,"h":136.4,"l":133.98,"c":133.98,"v":998400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":134.77,"h":136.15,"l":134.49,"c":135.11,"v":1130500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":134.0,"h":136.16,"l":134.0,"c":135.11,"v":2156300},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":135.89,"h":136.43,"l":134.7,"c":135.67,"v":1712400},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":135.99,"h":136.6,"l":135.53,"c":136.14,"v":898900},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":135.81,"h":138.0,"l":135.77,"c":137.97,"v":924300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":138.0,"h":138.92,"l":137.79,"c":138.76,"v":710